flowchart TD
    A([Page load]) --> B[(Read browser localStorage)]
    B --> C{Users empty?}
    C -- Yes --> D[Seed five plaintext demo accounts]
    C -- No --> E[Trust stored users as-is]
    D --> F[/User enters credentials/]
    E --> F
    F --> G{Exact plaintext match?}
    G -- No --> H[/Show generic error/]
    H --> F
    G -- Yes --> I[Set currentUser]
    I --> J[Hide menu buttons by role]
    J --> K{canAccess allows requested page?}
    K -- No --> L[/Show denied toast/]
    K -- Yes --> M[Run client-side function]
    X[/Local storage or page script is modified/] --> B
    M --> N[(Write data back to same browser storage)]
    N --> O([No server-side verification])
